## 1. Smoke Test Checklist – Food Delivery App

**App:** Zomato-style food delivery app
**Purpose:** Quickly check whether the important features are working after a new build.

| No. | Smoke Test Case                                              | Expected Result                           |
| --- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------- |
| 1   | Enter valid login details and tap **Login**.                 | User should log in successfully.          |
| 2   | Enter invalid login details.                                 | Proper error message should be displayed. |
| 3   | After login, open the **Dashboard/Home Page**.               | Dashboard should load without crashing.   |
| 4   | Search for a restaurant or food item from the dashboard.     | Relevant results should be displayed.     |
| 5   | Select a restaurant from the results.                        | Restaurant page should open correctly.    |
| 6   | Check the main dashboard sections such as offers/categories. | Important sections should load properly.  |

**Conclusion:**
These tests are quick checks to decide whether the new build is stable enough for detailed testing.

